9-                                                   Abstract. Let S be a Puiseux series of the germ of an analytically irreducible plane curve Z. We
10-                                                   provide a new perspective to construct a set of polynomials F = {F1 , . . . , Fg−1 } associated to S,
11-                                                   which is a special choice of maximal contact elements constructed in [AMB17] and approximate
12-                                                   roots defined in [Dur18], [AM73a], [AM73b]. Using these polynomials as building blocks, we describe
13-                                                   a set of generators of multiplier ideals of the form I(αZ) with 0 < α < 1 a rational number, which
14-                                                   recovers the results about irreducible plane curves in [AMB17], [Dur18].
