        with π ∗ Z having normal crossing support. We call this resolution the standard resolution of
        Z (see [BK86, Definition, page 498]). The multiplicity of the strict transform of Z at each
        center qi of the blow-up πi is denoted as Mi . Then the sequence (M1 , . . . , Mk ) is called the
        multiplicity sequence of Z.
