156-        generated by δ0 , δ1 , . . . , δi−1 , that we usually denote hδ0 , δ1 , . . . , δi−1 i.
157-    (3) δ0 > δ1 and δi < δi−1 ni−1 for i = 2, 3, . . . , g.
